OL,3,ATrump 'completely wrong' to restrict
OL,4,Asupport for Ukraine, Italian minister
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FItaly's defence minister has said it
OL,8,Fwas a "complete mistake, a major
OL,9,Fmistake" for the US to limit access to
OL,10,Fsatellite systems and intelligence used
OL,11,Fby Ukraine to defend itself against
OL,12,FRussian attacks.
OL,14,FGuido Crosetto warned in a BBC
OL,15,Finterview that any such move by US
OL,16,FPresident Donald Trump's administration
OL,17,F"makes absolutely no sense" and risked
OL,18,Fprolonging Russia's full-scale invasion
OL,19,Frather than helping to bring peace.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
