OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump 'completely wrong' to restrict
OL,4,Asupport for Ukraine, Italian minister
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS officials have said Trump has not
OL,8,Fasked for the slowdown of internet
OL,9,Fspeeds the US provides to Ukraine and
OL,10,Fwhich are vital for its war effort.
OL,11,FTrump has also denied that the US has
OL,12,Fstopped sharing early-warning alerts of
OL,13,Fincoming Russian aerial attacks with
OL,14,FUkraine.
OL,16,FCrosetto's comments continue Italy's
OL,17,Fsharpening criticism of the US.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
